PROJECT: Grass

Core Insights
Insight 1: Arsitektur DePIN dengan Dual Settlement-Execution Layer Memisahkan Keamanan Ekonomi dari Throughput Data
Explanation: Grass menggunakan Solana sebagai settlement layer final (token, staking, governance, anchoring) membangun Sovereign Data Rollup kustom (non-SVM) untuk eksekusi scraping/validasi data intensif komputasi — memisahkan security assumptions (Solana validator set) dari execution throughput (Rollup ZK/TEE)
Evidence: (HIGH) 【Phase 4 — System Architecture Settlement vs Execution Layer】【Phase 3 — EV-011 Sovereign Rollup Announcement】【Phase 8 — Narrative Modular Rollup】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 3 EV-011, Phase 4 System Architecture, Phase 8 Narrative Position
Confidence: HIGH

Insight 2: Ekspansi Platform Node Bertahap Menurunkan Barrier to Entry Secara Sistematis
Explanation: Grass merilis klien node bertahap: Desktop App (full control) → Browser Extension (ringan) → Mobile App iOS/Android (mass market) → Lite Node WASM (zero-install, lingkungan terbatasi) — setiap lapisan menambah segmen pengguna baru tanpa cannibalization
